WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.100
San Lucas, Kapitulo 3

00:30.000 --> 00:31.400
Ito ay ita at siyempo.

00:32.440 --> 00:33.860
Damtang tisao ti Diyos

00:33.860 --> 00:35.600
kay nguwan ng anak ni Sakaryas

00:35.600 --> 00:38.280
at daidin nguwan i-Jaylet Ang.

00:39.340 --> 00:40.940
Ngarod, sinursur na

00:40.940 --> 00:42.000
ti amin

00:42.000 --> 00:43.480
at iso ang madalanan

00:43.480 --> 00:44.700
ti Karayan Hordan.

00:45.440 --> 00:46.500
Agbabawi kayo

00:46.500 --> 00:48.040
kada gitibas-basulyo

00:48.040 --> 00:50.000
kahit pabunyagan kayo.

00:50.700 --> 00:51.780
Inkas kasabana.

00:52.580 --> 00:54.940
Itikasta pakawanin ti Diyos

00:54.940 --> 00:56.180
dagitibas-basulyo.

00:56.900 --> 00:58.240
Kasna ilanad iti libro

00:58.240 --> 00:59.520
ni Propeta Isayas.

01:00.000 --> 01:01.240
I-Jaylet Ang

01:01.240 --> 01:02.740
at damang ipukpukaw

01:02.740 --> 01:04.820
isaganayo ti dalan ti apu.

01:05.520 --> 01:07.360
Pasayaten nyo ti pagnaan na.

01:08.160 --> 01:09.600
Masapol ang magaburan

01:09.600 --> 01:10.960
dagit iamin alungog.

01:11.640 --> 01:13.080
Matpasimpa dagit iamin

01:13.080 --> 01:14.440
dabantay kenturod.

01:14.740 --> 01:16.960
Mapalinteg dagit i-killo-killo adalan.

01:17.720 --> 01:19.600
Matarimaan dagit i-lasong-lasong

01:19.600 --> 01:20.280
akalsada.

01:21.020 --> 01:23.080
Makitan to dagit iamin at at tao

01:23.080 --> 01:25.220
ti panangisalakan ti Diyos.

01:25.980 --> 01:27.400
Nakaad-ado at at tao

01:27.400 --> 01:29.600
tinapan ken huwantap no agpabunyag

01:29.600 --> 01:30.300
dakin kuwant.

01:31.000 --> 01:32.200
Kinunanang kadakwada,

01:32.860 --> 01:35.120
Dakayo akapututan ti karasaan

01:35.120 --> 01:36.780
siya sino tinangibaga

01:36.780 --> 01:38.920
amalisyan nyo tidandanin dumteng

01:38.920 --> 01:39.980
apan no sa ti Diyos?

01:40.940 --> 01:43.660
Ipakita nyo, babaen iti aramid nyo

01:43.660 --> 01:45.220
ang nagbabawi kayon

01:45.220 --> 01:46.540
kadagitibas-basulyo.

01:47.100 --> 01:48.820
Katdi yukon-kuna itibagiyo

01:48.820 --> 01:51.640
uray tanagtaod kam itikapututan

01:51.640 --> 01:52.220
ni Abraham.

01:53.020 --> 01:54.160
Ibagak kada kayo,

01:54.640 --> 01:57.020
akabailan ti Diyos apagbalinenda gitoy

01:57.020 --> 01:59.120
abato na anak ni Abraham.

01:59.600 --> 02:01.300
Naisaganan tiwasay

02:01.300 --> 02:03.340
apang pukan kadagiti kayo

02:03.340 --> 02:04.580
aging ga itiramot.

02:05.100 --> 02:07.540
Mapukan katmaipoor amin na kayo

02:07.540 --> 02:09.720
at iagbunga itinasayaat.

02:10.340 --> 02:11.700
Anyangarod ti masapol

02:11.700 --> 02:12.580
nga aramiden mi.

02:13.340 --> 02:15.120
Sinalodsod dagit itaktao

02:15.120 --> 02:17.580
ti adaan itidwa abado

02:17.580 --> 02:19.520
insungbat ni huwant.

02:20.320 --> 02:21.500
Masapol nga itidna

02:21.500 --> 02:22.800
timaysa itiawanan.

02:23.360 --> 02:24.440
Ti adaan kanen

02:24.440 --> 02:26.500
masapol amang ibingay.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.780
Napan ti sumagmamanong

02:28.780 --> 02:29.520
agsinsingir,

02:29.600 --> 02:30.520
at ibuwistapno

02:30.520 --> 02:31.480
at pabunyagda

02:31.480 --> 02:32.160
kenkuan.

02:32.920 --> 02:33.480
Maestro,

02:34.300 --> 02:34.840
kinunada,

02:35.700 --> 02:37.000
anya ti aramiden mi.

02:37.860 --> 02:39.220
Di kay agsinsingir

02:39.220 --> 02:41.140
itiadado ngam ititumutok.

02:41.820 --> 02:43.180
Imbaganang kadakwada,

02:44.080 --> 02:44.680
ketda kami.

02:45.660 --> 02:47.600
Sinalodsod met dagiti soldado.

02:48.340 --> 02:49.240
Anya ti masapol

02:49.240 --> 02:50.040
nga aramiden mi.

02:50.720 --> 02:51.760
Diyo butbutngen

02:51.760 --> 02:53.820
wenupadpadaksente siya sinuman

02:53.820 --> 02:55.960
tap numaalayo ti kwartana.

02:56.580 --> 02:58.340
Mapnek kayon iti swelduyo.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.540
Kinunana,

02:59.600 --> 03:00.300
kadakwada,

03:01.040 --> 03:01.680
di magkal

03:01.680 --> 03:02.440
tinamnama

03:02.440 --> 03:03.440
dagiti tattao.

03:03.980 --> 03:04.620
Impapanda

03:04.620 --> 03:05.340
anihuan

03:05.340 --> 03:06.040
ti Kristo.

03:06.400 --> 03:07.240
Kinunaniwan,

03:07.340 --> 03:07.980
kadakwada,

03:08.900 --> 03:10.400
bunyagan kayo itidanom.

03:11.060 --> 03:12.460
Ngamsumar sa runo kanyak

03:12.460 --> 03:13.840
timaysa adak-dakkel

03:13.840 --> 03:14.760
ti panakabalina

03:14.760 --> 03:15.400
ngamsyak.

03:16.080 --> 03:17.020
Jakpay may kari

03:17.020 --> 03:17.800
amang warwar

03:17.800 --> 03:18.860
itisandalyas na.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.460
Bunyagan na kayo

03:20.460 --> 03:21.820
iti spiritus anto

03:21.820 --> 03:22.760
ken apoy.

03:23.520 --> 03:24.440
Adda kenkwana

03:24.440 --> 03:25.160
tibigao

03:25.160 --> 03:26.600
apang taip na itiirik

03:26.600 --> 03:27.740
or nungan

03:27.740 --> 03:28.820
ken idulin nanto

03:28.820 --> 03:29.320
itiirik.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.320
Iti kamalig na.

03:30.980 --> 03:31.760
Ngang puuran

03:31.760 --> 03:32.620
nanto titaip

03:32.620 --> 03:33.420
iti apoy

03:33.420 --> 03:34.300
adi mo itip.

03:34.940 --> 03:35.440
Kastoy

03:35.440 --> 03:36.380
kenda dumapay

03:36.380 --> 03:37.200
abalakad

03:37.200 --> 03:38.460
ti imbagbaga niwan

03:38.460 --> 03:39.660
kadagiti tattao

03:39.660 --> 03:41.120
iti panangikasabana

03:41.120 --> 03:41.840
kadakwada

03:41.840 --> 03:42.920
iti naimbag

03:42.920 --> 03:43.440
adaman.

03:44.560 --> 03:44.920
Ngang

03:44.920 --> 03:45.900
binabalaw na

03:45.900 --> 03:47.280
ni Gobernador Herodes

03:47.280 --> 03:49.000
iti panangikabalay na

03:49.000 --> 03:49.940
kene Herodias

03:49.940 --> 03:50.840
nga asawa

03:50.840 --> 03:51.720
ni Kapsatna.

03:52.460 --> 03:53.060
Ken ga po

03:53.060 --> 03:53.920
kadagiti adu

03:53.920 --> 03:54.760
akinadakis

03:54.760 --> 03:55.900
nga inararamid na.

03:56.900 --> 03:57.760
Mainayon pay

03:57.760 --> 03:59.000
kadagiti inaramid na

03:59.000 --> 04:00.000
iti panang

04:00.000 --> 04:00.760
paibalod na

04:00.760 --> 04:01.440
ken huwan.

04:02.580 --> 04:03.500
Kalpasan iti panang

04:03.500 --> 04:04.060
kabunyag

04:04.060 --> 04:04.820
dagiti amin

04:04.820 --> 04:05.480
at tattao

04:05.480 --> 04:07.420
na bunyagan mat

04:07.420 --> 04:08.000
ni Jesus.

04:08.820 --> 04:10.020
Idi agkar kararag

04:10.020 --> 04:11.460
na luktani

04:11.460 --> 04:12.140
ti langit

04:12.140 --> 04:13.840
kad tinmabakin

04:13.840 --> 04:14.260
kwana

04:14.260 --> 04:15.720
ti Spiritus Santo

04:15.720 --> 04:16.760
akas may sa

04:16.760 --> 04:17.600
akalapati

04:17.600 --> 04:19.260
at datimig

04:19.260 --> 04:19.920
ang naggapot

04:19.920 --> 04:20.660
sa dilangit.

04:21.260 --> 04:21.720
Sika

04:21.720 --> 04:22.700
tidungdungwit

04:22.700 --> 04:23.460
ng anak ko.

04:24.180 --> 04:24.800
Kinunana

04:24.800 --> 04:26.480
may ayo

04:26.480 --> 04:27.280
akunay

04:27.280 --> 04:27.780
ken ka.

04:28.540 --> 04:28.920
Agtal

04:28.920 --> 04:29.300
pupulo

04:29.300 --> 04:30.400
titawan ni Jesus

04:30.400 --> 04:31.360
idurugyan na

04:31.360 --> 04:32.180
titrabaho na.

04:32.980 --> 04:33.500
Hindi lang

04:33.500 --> 04:34.340
dagitita tao

04:34.340 --> 04:34.800
nga iso

04:34.800 --> 04:35.580
ti anak ni Jose,

04:36.420 --> 04:37.240
nga anak ni Eli,

04:38.140 --> 04:39.180
nga anak ni Matat,

04:39.840 --> 04:40.700
nga anak ni Levi,

04:41.620 --> 04:42.580
nga anak ni Melki,

04:43.320 --> 04:44.380
nga anak ni Hane,

04:45.100 --> 04:45.940
nga anak ni Jose,

04:46.760 --> 04:48.000
nga anak ni Matatyas,

04:48.820 --> 04:49.840
nga anak ni Amos,

04:50.700 --> 04:51.680
nga anak ni Nahong,

04:52.420 --> 04:53.380
nga anak ni Esli,

04:54.040 --> 04:54.920
nga anak ni Nage,

04:55.700 --> 04:56.680
nga anak ni Maat,

04:57.360 --> 04:58.640
nga anak ni Matatyas,

04:58.920 --> 05:00.400
nga anak ni Simey,

05:00.840 --> 05:02.180
nga anak ni Jose,

05:02.560 --> 05:03.640
nga anak ni Huda,

05:04.300 --> 05:05.540
